## Mitigation Strategy

The primary mitigation is not a physical hardware redesign.

The strongest near-term mitigation is to improve profile architecture and mode annunciation.

### Recommended Near-Term Mitigations

| Mitigation ID | Mitigation | Related Requirement |
|--------------|------------|---------------------|
| MIT-001 | Add Integrated Avionics Mode and Independent Navigator Mode | FHA-REQ-009 |
| MIT-002 | Provide FMS1/FMS2 parity in Independent Navigator Mode | FHA-REQ-002 |
| MIT-003 | Implement Shift + FMS1 Pan/Zoom mode | FHA-REQ-005 |
| MIT-004 | Implement Shift + FMS2 Pan/Zoom mode | FHA-REQ-006 |
| MIT-005 | Blink selected mode LED when shift mode is active | FHA-REQ-007 |
| MIT-006 | Expose FMS and LED states to external profiles | FHA-REQ-008 |

